-- C_ADA_ONLY: the experimental Python and Rust decoders keep the previous element's field in this shape (Rust: 2 round trips fail; its output is not changed by the C / Ada fix)
-- A present-when BOOLEAN field of an OPTIONAL component inside a SEQUENCE OF element, its dependent outside the
-- component: the field's decode local is declared once, before the loop, so an element without the component used to
-- see the previous element's field (a wrong value: x present with a size from the previous element). The decoders set
-- it to FALSE at the start of every element. x present implies h present (its present-when field is in h), so the size
-- of x needs no check.
TEST-CASE DEFINITIONS AUTOMATIC TAGS::= BEGIN
    SqPDU ::= SEQUENCE (SIZE(2)) OF SEQUENCE {
        h    SEQUENCE { a INTEGER (0..1) } OPTIONAL,
        x    OCTET STRING (SIZE(0..15)) OPTIONAL,
        tail INTEGER (0..1)
    }
END

